From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 15:02:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add the 2026-10-04 multibagger shortlist to the universe (12
 symbols) [skip ci]

Adds the ten best fits from the investing Project's multibagger screen
(claude/Multibagger_Screen_20261004.md, section 11) plus the two Japanese
alternates, so the weekly refresh builds their price history for 48-month
realized volatility and drawdown work:

  APPF  AppFolio            NU     Nu Holdings
  CSU.TO Constellation Soft. ONON   On Holding
  KNSL  Kinsale Capital      PAY    Paymentus
  KSPI  Kaspi.kz (ADS)       TOI.V  Topicus.com
  MEDP  Medpace              4194.T Visional
  3923.T Rakus               3697.T SHIFT

First non-US listings in the universe. No script change is needed:
pull.py writes prices/CSU.TO.csv, prices/4194.T.csv etc. (only dashes are
stripped) and validate.py maps the stem back to the symbol; verified with a
dry run of validate.py on dotted file names. tickers.txt stays alphabetical
(ASCII order: digits first). README documents the suffix rule.

[skip ci] so the branch push does not commit a full refresh; after merging,
dispatch refresh-prices with
tickers=3697.T,3923.T,4194.T,APPF,CSU.TO,KNSL,KSPI,MEDP,NU,ONON,PAY,TOI.V
or wait for the Monday 09:20 UTC run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
